--- !u!114 &859675213
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 859675209}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 63ee55158351f455788396190c5e79d2, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  useTriggerMode: 1
  speakerName: Big man Demetra
  dialogueLines: []
  oneTimeOnly: 1
  useConversationMode: 1
  conversationLines:
  - speaker: Big man Demetra
    text: Yo, where you been at, bro? dont you disappear like that.
  - speaker: 
    text: "Busy doin\u2019 what? Ain\u2019t nobody that busy unless you secretly
      Batman."
  - speaker: Big man Demetra
    text: "First of all, I ain\u2019t Batman\u2026 but I do look good in black."
  - speaker: 
    text: Boy please, last time you wore all black you looked like a trash bag with
      confidence.
  - speaker: Big man Demetra
    text: "Wow, that\u2019s crazy. Real supportive. I see how it is."
  - speaker: 
    text: "I support you\u2026 just not your fashion choices."
  - speaker: Big man Demetra
    text: "Whatever. At least I don\u2019t still owe people money from 2019."
  - speaker: 
    text: "Hey, that was a loan, not a debt. There\u2019s a difference."
  - speaker: Big man Demetra
    text: "Yeah\u2014the difference is you ain\u2019t paid it back."
  - speaker: 
    text: "Man, you keep bringin\u2019 up old stuff. You need healing."
  - speaker: Big man Demetra
    text: "I need my money, that\u2019s what I need."
  - speaker: 
    text: "Alright, alright\u2026 I got you soon."
  - speaker: Big man Demetra
    text: "Soon\u2019 been comin\u2019 for 6 years, bro."
  - speaker: 
    text: "Aight listen\u2014forget all that. You tryna chill or you just here to
      roast me?"
  - speaker: Big man Demetra
    text: I can do both. Multitasking.
  - speaker: 
    text: "Bet. Pull up to my place later, I got snacks\u2026 and I might even let
      you win in 2K."
  - speaker: Big man Demetra
    text: "Might? Oh nah, now I\u2019m definitely comin\u2019. Send the addy."
  npcAnimator: {fileID: 859675211}
  freezeAnimationOnInteract: 1
  idleNormalizedTime: 0
  freezeEnemies: 0
  enemyTag: Enemy
  onDialogueComplete:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
